{
  "id": "6a813fdd39b51e08c19e1325",
  "title": "AI動画クオリアさん",
  "created": 1786855390,
  "updated": 1786872249,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a813fdd39b51e08c19e1325",
      "text": "AI動画クオリアさん",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c17",
      "text": "from [2026/08/14]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c18",
      "text": "AI動画クオリアさん",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fe80000000000172c34",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855401,
      "updated": 1786855401
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fe70000000000172c33",
      "text": "[nishio.icon]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855399,
      "updated": 1786855401
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c19",
      "text": "ゲーミングPCに入れたCodexに動画生成を指示してる",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c1a",
      "text": "ver1は音声もMiniMax H3、日本語の一部が壊れてしまった",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c1b",
      "text": "\t[https://scrapbox.io/files/6a7ef998df81a13e54974550.mp4]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c1c",
      "text": "\t　発音やイントネーションの面では、この4つのサンプルの中では一番違和感なく聴こえる[Nrem.icon][takker.icon][Hiro Aki.icon][sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786856095
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c1d",
      "text": "\t　#クオリアさんが解説する動画",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c1e",
      "text": "そこで音声をVOICEVOXに変えたら(v2)、リップシンクしなくなった",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c1f",
      "text": "\t[https://scrapbox.io/files/6a7ef9bbdf81a13e54974590.mp4]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c20",
      "text": "\t\t「こんにちは、賢いホモ──サピエンスの皆さん」みたいに聴こえる[Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c21",
      "text": "\t\t\t「ホモ・サピエンス」を中黒で区切りがち[nishio.icon]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c22",
      "text": "Codexになんとかしてって言ったら口パクだけ上から重ねて生成してた",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c23",
      "text": "\t[https://scrapbox.io/files/6a7ef9e7df81a13e549745d7.mp4]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c24",
      "text": "あざといバージョン",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c25",
      "text": "\t[https://scrapbox.io/files/6a7efa07df81a13e54974617.mp4]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c26",
      "text": "ところで動画をこのCosenseプロジェクトにアップロードしてストレージ容量は大丈夫なのだろうか",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c27",
      "text": " [nishio.icon]さんのアカウントのストレージ容量が使われるはず[takker.icon]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c28",
      "text": " \tなら安心[nishio.icon]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c29",
      "text": "仕事がひと段落ついた躁状態で色んなことをやりすぎてCodexのトークンが心もとなくなってきたw",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c2a",
      "text": "\tなんか爆誕しつつある",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c2b",
      "text": "\t[https://gyazo.com/d08cd8c2873261fe24702397759d792e]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c2c",
      "text": "\tLive2Dのこと何も知らないまま何かが出来上がりつつある、謎",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c2d",
      "text": "\t「わかってから作る」と「作ってからわかる」がある、という言語化が降ってきた",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c2e",
      "text": ">日本での利用には特に問題はないのですが、EU・英国・韓国・米国での利用だけでなく、生成物の「表示」まで明示的に不許諾です。 --- [ASCII.jp：とんでもない動画生成AIが出てきた　無料で試し放題の「MiniMax H3」を徹底検証 (4/5) https://ascii.jp/elem/000/004/426/4426043/4/]",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c2f",
      "text": "\tへえー、そうなんだ",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c30",
      "text": "\t何もわからないまま「動画生成のおすすめは？」って聞いて出てきたのをやったのだが、割と最近出てきたモデルだったのか",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
    {
      "id": "6a813fde0000000000172c31",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "582e63d27c56960011aff09e",
      "created": 1786855390,
      "updated": 1786855390
    },
